  "title": "Cincinnati-Style Chili",
  "description": "This is a vegetarian version of Cincinnati chili, similar to Skyline&#39;s. This recipe uses burger-style crumbles, and surprises like cinnamon and cocoa.",
  "authors": [
    "Karen C. Greenlee"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-06-20T13:46:46-04:00",
